    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like RC cars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In RC Crash Course you can collect and race RC cars in many different courses and game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D obstacle courses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/0377ae18c3a050357b5f9935d6d130b3.poster.avif?t=1753136786\" width=480 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/0377ae18c3a050357b5f9935d6d130b3.webm?t=1753136786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/0377ae18c3a050357b5f9935d6d130b3.mp4?t=1753136786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RC Rally in the mud and on the beach</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/dd87073dd13162b4cd402fab2382e56e.poster.avif?t=1753136786\" width=540 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/dd87073dd13162b4cd402fab2382e56e.webm?t=1753136786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/dd87073dd13162b4cd402fab2382e56e.mp4?t=1753136786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496620/extras/6df51d4c36c52e6